<title>USA: PaineWebber names Ronzetti to division.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber names Ronzetti to division.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Monday it named Richard Ronzetti a managing director and head of emerging markets research in the global fixed income division.</p>
<p>The company said the job is a newly created position.</p>
<p>Ronzetti was previously a senior analyst and vice president in charge of emerging markets fixed income research at Smith Barney.</p>
